{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PHANTOM is a Ghost Hunting game, With over 10 Planned Locations Inspired by Real, and Unusual Places.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 Different Ghost Types, with 3 Evidence Per Ghost Type. and 11 Evidence Total. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>With a EMF Reader, Thermometer, UV Light, Spirit box, Parabolic Mic, and Camera as your Main Evidence Items. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full release, Some maps will have a Story Level:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Story Levels vary in Style. Some will be Actual gameplay, While others will be more Cutscene-like, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The purpose of the Story Levels is to show you how a place got Haunted, or why a place was Abandoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <strong><u>The Safe House\u00a0</u></strong><br> <strong>On The Ghost Tab</strong>, You'll be able to do investigations at Most of the Maps,<br>Complete with Hunts, and Stress Mechanics.<br> <br><strong>In the Arcade</strong>, You'll have access to all the maps from the Investigations, Tab,  <br>As well as Bonus Maps! the first of which, being The Ghost Ship  <br>the Arcade Investigations have no Hunts or Stress Mechanics  <br>  <br><strong>Player Upgrades</strong>,<br>You'll be able to upgrade all of the Equipment Items, <br>From Better Range, to quicker activation, and more accurate results <br>And the Player,  From faster walk speed, to better visibility in the Dark. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player only.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Made in Unreal Engine 5.4</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2462440?t=1745213196","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745213196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app